// The Piscatoris tracking grounds, read off the imported map (tools: import474rect.py, 474 locs kept as
// their own - see configs/hunter_piscatoris.loc): every plant and burrow a trail can pass through, and every
// bush a kebbit can end up in. The common kebbits' ground is the south one (m36_55), the razor-backed
// kebbits' the north (m36_56). Regenerate from the map, not by hand, if the map changes - a coord here
// with no node on it is a trail step nobody can inspect.

[hunter_pisc_common_nodes]
