// THE FALCONRY ENCLOSURE, row by row: for each z inside Matthias's fence, the westernmost and easternmost x
// a player can stand on there, as min * 10000 + max (so 3573 -> 2372..2376). Read off a flood fill of the
// engine's own collision from Matthias's spot; hunter_live's pisc_map pass checks it still matches. The
// fence is no rectangle - it bulges east in the middle and pinches in at both ends - hence a row each.
